@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5078

### 会员登录（USERS + BCrypt）
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginType": "member",
  "loginName": "demo_member",
  "password": "Demo@123456"
}

### 会员注册（先 USERS 后 MEMBER）
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginName": "new_member",
  "password": "Demo@123456",
  "name": "新会员",
  "phoneNumber": "13900000002",
  "gender": "M"
}

### 查询会员
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/members/1
Accept: application/json

### 更新会员档案
PUT {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/members/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "演示会员",
  "phoneNumber": "13800000001",
  "gender": "M"
}
